  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 314.04 Other Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 314.04 Other Information. If the information submitted is insufficient for the department to make an independent determination that the facility and all persons associated therewith comply with the requirements of RSA 149-M and the solid waste rules and protect human health, safety, and the environment, the applicant shall submit such additional information as the department determines necessary to make the determination.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (formerly Env-Sw 314.13) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
